## 编译输出
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
*.cache
*.userprefs
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## NuGet
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
*.nupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/repositories.config
nuget.exe

## Visual Studio
.vs/
*.sln.ide/
*.rsuser
[Aa]utomationSettings.json

## Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

## VS Code
.vscode/

## macOS
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~

## Test Results / Coverage
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info
*.lcov
coveragereport/

## Benchmark 输出
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

## 临时文件
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
*.log
